        "date_published": "2026-09-22T14:00:06+00:00",
        "description": "Control Resonant is a massive departure from the original Control, with a bigger world, new combat systems, and plenty of secrets that the game doesn't always explain. After spending a bunch of time in this twisted version of Manhattan, we've rounded up 10 useful things Control Resonant doesn't tell you.\n \nFrom changing your Aberrant Forms and swapping your loadout in combat to finding hidden upgrades, tracking down vendors, understanding how the open world works, and using Resource Crates to uncover secrets, these tips should help you get the most out of your time in Control Resonant. Don't worry, there are no major story spoilers.\n \n0:00 - Intro\n0:23 - You Can Change Up Your Aberrant Form\n1:24 - You Can Swap Up Your Loadout\n1:55 - Vendors Sell Different Things in Different Zones  \n2:57 - You Always Get Reset Items From Resonants\n3:26 - The World is Bigger Than You Think\n4:07 - You Can Turn on Assist Mode At Any Time\n4:40 - The Open World Has Some Caveats \n5:30 - Upgrades Are Hidden ",
        "id": 6431248,
